{
  "_doc": [
    "Example DCE *run config*: which data to process, and only the settings this run",
    "overrides. Copy it, point the paths at your own session, and edit.",
    "",
    "Every other knob resolves from python/dce_defaults.json, which is the single source",
    "for defaults, limits and preferences. Restating a default here would fork it, so keys",
    "whose value matches the defaults file are deliberately absent.",
    "",
    "'relaxivity' has no default anywhere and must be supplied per run -- here, or (better)",
    "in the DCE image's JSON sidecar, which wins over this file."
  ],
